  "title": "Display HP and MP Regeneration Simultaneously [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "ＨＰ再生とＭＰ再生を同時表示【RPGツクールMZプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "595bebd2e2b7f257339add7cf6f1a9d72f471359756a78fb7a91eb98d290ebe6",
      "translation": "Display HP and MP Regeneration Simultaneously [RPG Maker MZ Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "595bebd2e2b7f257339add7cf6f1a9d72f471359756a78fb7a91eb98d290ebe6"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "HP再生率とMP再生率を同時に設定した場合、ツクールには回復量を片方しか表示できない仕様（バグ？）があります。",
      "sourceHash": "40c85ba7cab63f99af594cbba346cb397ccd5272043a792de9dde129a9f9e261",
      "translation": "When both HP Regeneration and MP Regeneration are set, RPG Maker has a specification (or bug?) that allows it to display the recovery amount for only one of them.",
      "contextHash": "40c85ba7cab63f99af594cbba346cb397ccd5272043a792de9dde129a9f9e261"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "そこでこの仕様を改善し、同時にＨＰ再生とＭＰ再生を表示できるようにします。",
      "sourceHash": "8a2a7946598f8ae48202951e4b9d187b96bbd7033fa4dc8da8875e38ac6e01e1",
      "translation": "This plugin improves this behavior, allowing HP and MP regeneration to be displayed simultaneously.",
      "contextHash": "8a2a7946598f8ae48202951e4b9d187b96bbd7033fa4dc8da8875e38ac6e01e1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、TP再生率にも対応していますが、初期状態ではTP再生の値は表示されないので、表示用のプラグインを他に用意する必要があります。",
      "sourceHash": "4831313768b384d1338c59ef1f27552f3d1574b0efc91eabec886ee14a075a01",
      "translation": "TP Regeneration Rate is also supported. However, TP regeneration values are not displayed by default, so you will need another plugin to display them.",
      "contextHash": "4831313768b384d1338c59ef1f27552f3d1574b0efc91eabec886ee14a075a01"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "Installation (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn on the plugin from RPG Maker's Plugin Manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＺ専用です。",
      "sourceHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d",
      "translation": "※This plugin is for MZ only.",
      "contextHash": "ed0c5667915fe7ad6e95a93a20e8331a11f4cc8b43f40dd22f930598cecbf19d"
    },
    {
      "id": "link-001",
