      "sourceHash": "2cfab218a1bef3ea64f2dd6ac7c08f465c947cd3aa0017f074895e5fcaaa7717",
      "translation": "Fixed an issue where the damage display timing became misaligned. (ver1.001)",
      "contextHash": "2cfab218a1bef3ea64f2dd6ac7c08f465c947cd3aa0017f074895e5fcaaa7717"
    },
    {
